---
// "Watch the demo instead of manually testing": a static open card, as the app shows a finished task:
// the demo video with its chapters and the decisions on the left, the conversation on the right. The video comes later.
---
<div class="rv" role="img" aria-label="An open task card showing a demo video, Approve, Later and Stop buttons, and a conversation with the agent">
  <div class="rv-head">
    <div class="rv-kind">Task</div>
    <div class="rv-title">Add dark mode</div>
    <div class="rv-state">● Demo ready</div>
  </div>
  <div class="rv-cols">
    <div class="rv-left">
      <div class="rv-video"><span class="rv-play"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span><span class="rv-soon">Demo video coming soon</span>
        <span class="rv-bar"><i></i></span></div>
      <ul class="rv-chapters"><li><span>0:00</span>Follows the system</li><li><span>0:11</span>The toggle in the top bar</li><li><span>0:19</span>Remembers the choice</li></ul>
      <div class="rv-actions"><span class="btn dark">Approve</span><span class="btn">Later …</span><span class="btn">Stop</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="rv-right">
      <div class="rv-cap">Conversation</div>
      <div class="rv-chat">
        <div class="msg you"><b>You · Task</b>Follow the system setting, with a toggle in the top bar.</div>
        <div class="note">Agent started on seismic/dark-mode</div>
        <div class="msg agent"><b>Agent · Handover</b>Dark mode follows the system, and the toggle remembers your choice. The demo shows both.</div>
        <div class="msg you"><b>You · at 0:19</b>Can the toggle sit left of the search button?</div>
        <div class="note">Agent is back at work</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rv-compose">Write about 0:19 or hold space</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style is:global>
  .rv { position: relative; border-radius: 14px; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--glass-edge); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 var(--glass-hi), var(--lift); padding: 26px 30px 26px; }
  .rv::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 30px; top: -1px; width: 80px; height: 3px; border-radius: 0 0 3px 3px; background: var(--amber); box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--amber); }
  .rv-kind { font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; color: var(--muted); }
  .rv-title { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: -.018em; line-height: 1.12; margin: 2px 0 6px; }
  .rv-state { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--amber); }
  .rv-cols { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.7fr 1fr; gap: 28px; margin-top: 20px; }
  .rv-video { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; border-radius: 10px; display: grid; place-items: center; color: #fff; overflow: hidden;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3a4a63, #1c2535); }
  .rv-play { width: 54px; height: 54px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; background: rgba(0,0,0,.45); }
  .rv-soon { position: absolute; top: 10px; left: 12px; font-size: 12px; opacity: .75; }
  .rv-bar { position: absolute; left: 14px; right: 14px; bottom: 12px; height: 3px; border-radius: 3px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.3); }
  .rv-bar i { display: block; width: 40%; height: 100%; border-radius: 3px; background: #fff; }
  .rv-chapters { list-style: none; margin: 10px 0 0; padding: 6px 0; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--chip); font-size: 14px; }
  .rv-chapters li { padding: 6px 14px; } .rv-chapters span { display: inline-block; width: 3em; color: var(--muted); }
  .rv-actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .rv-actions .btn { padding: 9px 16px; font-size: 15px; background: var(--chip); border-radius: 10px; }
  .rv-actions .btn.dark { background: var(--ink); color: var(--bg); }
  .rv-cap { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .rv-chat { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; padding: 12px; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--chip); font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.4; }
  .rv-chat .msg { padding: 8px 11px; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--glass-edge); max-width: 92%; }
  .rv-chat .msg b { display: block; font-size: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 2px; color: var(--blue); }
  .rv-chat .msg.agent b { color: var(--amber); } .rv-chat .msg.you { align-self: flex-end; }
  .rv-chat .note { font-size: 11.5px; font-style: italic; text-align: center; color: var(--muted); }
  .rv-compose { margin-top: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--muted); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .rv { padding: 22px 18px; } .rv-cols { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .rv-title { font-size: 24px; } }
</style>
